000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.       TFRGTRPT.
000400 AUTHOR.           DALE HOERLE.
000500*INSTALLATION.     GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER CO.
000600 DATE-WRITTEN.     JULY 1985.
000700 DATE-COMPILED.
000800*REMARKS.
000900*
001000*       FEB. 05,  1986
001100*          1. CALLS TESCSEQ FOR EXTERNALLY SUPPLIED
001200*             ESCAPE SEQUENCES.
001300*          2. COPIES ESC-NAME FROM COPYLIB.DB.
001400*          3. MOVES ADDED TO INSERT PROPER ESCAPE
001500*             SEQUENCES FOR PRINTING.
001600*                 CATHERINE KALMAN.
001700*
      *C   10FEB1994    DAVE PLUM
      *C     ADDED CALL TO THE COBOL ERROR HANDLER - MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C   11JUL1996    CA YODER
      *C     RE-COMPILED TO PICK UP CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.

001900 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
002000 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002100 SOURCE-COMPUTER.   HP-3000.
002200 OBJECT-COMPUTER.   HP-3000.
002300
007200 SPECIAL-NAMES. C01 IS NEW-PAGE.
002600
002700 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
002800 FILE-CONTROL.
004000     SELECT SORT-FILE      ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.
004100     SELECT PRINT-FILE     ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.
            SELECT DFREIGHT
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2401
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
003200
003300 DATA DIVISION.
003400 FILE SECTION.
003500 FD PRINT-FILE
003600     RECORD CONTAINS 132 CHARACTERS
003700     DATA RECORD IS PRINT-RECORD.
003800 01  PRINT-RECORD.
003900     05  PRINT-LINE               PIC X(132).
004000
004100 SD SORT-FILE
004200     RECORD CONTAINS 90 CHARACTERS
004300     DATA RECORD IS SORT-RECORD.
004400 01  SORT-RECORD.
004500     05  SRT-PO-RCV-NO.
004600         10  SRT-PO               PIC X(7).
004700         10  SRT-RLSE-NO          PIC X(3).
004800         10  SRT-RCV-NO           PIC X(3).
004900     05  SRT-CARRIER              PIC X(4).
005000     05  SRT-BILL-NO              PIC X(16).
005100     05  SRT-PACK-SLIP            PIC X(12).
005200     05  SRT-CHARGES              PIC 9(11)V99.
005300     05  SRT-BILL-DATE            PIC X(6).
005400     05  SRT-DATE-RCVD            PIC X(6).
005500     05  SRT-SPLC                 PIC X(10).
005600     05  SRT-RAIL-CAR             PIC X(10).
005700
       FD  DFREIGHT
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DFREIGHT-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS2400  OF MCFLCS2401.

005800 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
005900**************************************************************
006000*           W O R K I N G         S T O R A G E              *
006100**************************************************************
       77  MCXCBLERR-SCOPE              PIC X(1)  VALUE "C".

       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X.

       01  SAVE-DATE                    PIC X(8).
006200
006300 01  COUNTERS.
006400     05  LINE-CTR                 PIC 9(4)  VALUE 99.
006500     05  PAGE-CTR                 PIC 9(4)  VALUE 0.
006600
007100*************************************************************
007200**                                                         **
007300**             D A T A B A S E   B U F F E R S             **
007400**                                                         **
007500*************************************************************
007600 COPY OVRPFDATA OF COPYLIB.
007700 COPY DFREIGHT OF COPYLIB.
007800 COPY CCHKOBJ  OF COPYLIB.
007900*************************************************************
008000**                                                         **
008100**  D A T A B A S E   C O M M U N I C A T I O N   A R E A  **
008200**                                                         **
008300*************************************************************
008400
008500 COPY DATAB OF COPYLIB.
008600
009400 01  ARGUMENT-VALUES.
009500     05  PO-ARG                PIC X(14)    VALUE SPACE.
009600
009700 COPY TDATECHK OF COPYLIB.
009900 COPY THDPRTA  OF COPYLIB.
010300 COPY TBLOWUP  OF COPYLIB.
010400
010600************************************************************
010700*                 P R I N T   A R E A
010800************************************************************
010900
011000 01  PRT-LINE.
011100     05  PRT-PO                   PIC X(8).
011200     05  PRT-RLSE-NO              PIC X(3).
011300     05  PRT-DASH                 PIC X.
011400     05  PRT-RCV-NO               PIC X(3).
011500     05  FILLER                   PIC X(4).
011600     05  PRT-PACK-SLIP            PIC X(12).
011700     05  FILLER                   PIC X(5).
011800     05  PRT-CARRIER              PIC X(4).
011900     05  FILLER                   PIC X(5).
012000     05  PRT-BILL-NO              PIC X(16).
012100     05  FILLER                   PIC X(1).
012200     05  PRT-CHARGES              PIC -(11)9.99.
012300     05  FILLER                   PIC X(5).
012400     05  PRT-BILL-DATE            PIC X(8).
012500     05  FILLER                   PIC X(5).
012600     05  PRT-DATE-RCVD            PIC X(8).
012700     05  FILLER                   PIC X(3).
012800     05  PRT-SPLC                 PIC X(10).
012900     05  FILLER                   PIC X(3).
013000     05  PRT-RAIL-CAR             PIC X(10).
013100
013300 01  HEADER-1.
013400     05  FILLER                   PIC X(9) VALUE "PAGE NO.".
013500     05  PAGE-NO                  PIC ZZZ9  VALUE ZERO.
013600     05  FILLER                   PIC X(6) VALUE SPACE.
013700     05  FILLER                   PIC X(49)
013800      VALUE "              U N A P P L I E D   F R E I G H T".
013900     05  FILLER                   PIC X(25)
014000      VALUE "   R E P O R T".
014100     05  PRT-DATE                PIC X(10).
014200 01  HEADER-2.
014300     05  FILLER                  PIC X(44)
014400      VALUE "P.O.        RCV    PACK. SLIP     CARRIER   ".
014500     05  FILLER                   PIC X(50)
014600      VALUE " PRO NUMBER               CHARGES    BILL DATE".
014700     05  FILLER                   PIC X(35)
014800      VALUE "DATE RCVD   SPLC         RAIL CAR".
014900 01  HEADER-3.
015000     05  FILLER                   PIC X(50)
015100      VALUE "--------------------------------------------------".
015200     05  FILLER                   PIC X(50)
015300      VALUE "--------------------------------------------------".
015400     05  FILLER                   PIC X(32)
015500            VALUE "--------------------------------".
015600 01  HEADER-4.
015700     05  FILLER                   PIC X(132) VALUE SPACE.
